body:
Game requires local LLM server at startup, blocking static GitHub Pages deployment. Implemented automatic test mode detection via pathname to bypass LLM requirement when deployed.

## Changes

**Workflow** (`.github/workflows/pages-deploy.yml`)
- Changed trigger from `push` to `workflow_dispatch` (manual only)
- Uses `npm run build:pages` for Pages-specific build

**Build configuration** (`vite.config.ts`)
- Sets `base: '/EmilysGame/'` when `mode === 'pages'`
- Ensures asset paths work at `https://username.github.io/EmilysGame/`

**LLM bypass** (`src/llm.ts`)
- Added pathname detection: `url.pathname.startsWith('/EmilysGame/')` → test mode
- No environment variables needed, runtime detection only

```typescript
export function isTestMode(): boolean {
  if (_testMode !== null) return _testMode;
  try {
    const url = new URL(window.location.href);
    if (url.searchParams.get('test') === '0') { _testMode = false; return false; }
    if (url.searchParams.get('test') === '1') { _testMode = true; return true; }
    // Detect GitHub Pages deployment by pathname prefix
    if (url.pathname.startsWith('/EmilysGame/')) { _testMode = true; return true; }
    if (navigator.webdriver) { _testMode = true; return true; }
  } catch { /* SSR or no window */ }
  _testMode = false;
  return false;
}
```

**Build script** (`package.json`)
- Added `build:pages`: `npm run build-wasm && vite build --mode pages`

**Documentation** (`DEPLOYMENT.md`)
- Deployment instructions, troubleshooting, local testing guide

## Deploy

Actions → "Deploy — GitHub Pages (Manual)" → Run workflow

Game loads at `https://putersdcat.github.io/EmilysGame/` with LLM automatically bypassed.

